.alert.alert-light.border
  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Goal of this page
  %p.mb-3
    Let the employee acknowledge each latest finalized check-in rating with Agree or Disagree (optional notes), so voice is on the employment record without implying blanket agreement.

  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Context
  = render 'shared/maap/definition'
  = render 'shared/check_ins/three_step_clarity_flow', organization: organization, teammate: @teammate

  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Specifics of this page
  %ul.mb-0
    %li Shows only the <strong>latest finalized</strong> position, assignment, and aspirational value check-ins that still need acknowledgement.
    %li Per check-in choose <strong>Leave Unacknowledged</strong> (default), <strong>Acknowledge and Agree</strong>, or <strong>Acknowledge and Disagree</strong>; notes are optional.
    %li Use <strong>Set all to Agree</strong> then <strong>Save All</strong> to submit every Agree/Disagree choice in one pass. Leave Unacknowledged rows are skipped.
    %li Once saved, acknowledgement cannot be changed.
    %li Hover employee / manager / Reviewed Together ratings for notes.
    %li This Beta path does not clear snapshot-based pending acknowledgement used by GSD and health — use the audit page for that until a later phase.
